tor.services.mozilla.com/D336977\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340817\n", "files": ["mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/BasicSelectionActionDelegate.java"], "git_node": "34e5f6bf8bce697a776f6b4e71b4a4156284f5f9", "git_parents": ["633c4e1e6528cfbc066d9f2760bfa372ade731fd"], "node": "e6712c3c0565d21b13a15ce6b70ae032ab0c2f2d", "parents": ["de2af967e694a34e50810a92dd5415d28953e186"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794236002, "git_changesets": ["34e5f6bf8bce697a776f6b4e71b4a4156284f5f9"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "29323": {"changesets": [{"author": "Francesco Lodolo \u003cflod@lodolo.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088856 - Fix browser_ext_slow_script.js looking up the Stop button by its label, and avoid hangs when it fails.  a=diannaS\n\nThe Stop button label is now set asynchronously by Fluent. If the test fails,\nstop the hung script during cleanup, and let the hang notification fall back\nto the add-on ID once the extension has been unloaded.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D339511\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340601\n", "files": ["browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_slow_script.js", "browser/modules/ProcessHangMonitor.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "76d36198af454146c9275a33126dc3a28fa16cc8", "git_parents": ["34e5f6bf8bce697a776f6b4e71b4a4156284f5f9"], "node": "2981d9a105874ab4a59e6f40fc30a67b4fa22d5b", "parents": ["e6712c3c0565d21b13a15ce6b70ae032ab0c2f2d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794236046, "git_changesets": ["76d36198af454146c9275a33126dc3a28fa16cc8"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "29324": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088688 - Use ValidateFontDescriptor in WebRenderBridgeParent.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340224\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340620\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/ScaledFontFontconfig.cpp", "gfx/2d/UnscaledFontFreeType.h", "gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderBridgeParent.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/WebRenderTypes.h"], "git_node": "d7a298e84a21c1a22a95884bc316afb4569b88df", "git_parents": ["76d36198af454146c9275a33126dc3a28fa16cc8"], "node": "ad4f2628794d01658ddc44b08d984c2b72253221", "parents": ["2981d9a105874ab4a59e6f40fc30a67b4fa22d5b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794236886, "git_changesets": ["d7a298e84a21c1a22a95884bc316afb4569b88df"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "29325": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089704.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340297\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340608\n", "files": ["dom/webidl/StyleSheet.webidl", "layout/style/StyleSheet.h"], "git_node": "f2d24e7af25e4de53f0730a7df43207f51200c9f", "git_parents": ["d7a298e84a21c1a22a95884bc316afb4569b88df"], "node": "e41efab3fb7307b76b3c8ba5b6eb60a9192de8c6", "parents": ["ad4f2628794d01658ddc44b08d984c2b72253221"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794236907, "git_changesets": ["f2d24e7af25e4de53f0730a7df43207f51200c9f"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "29326": {"changesets": [{"author": "Alastor Wu \u003calwu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059999 - Match the media engine of a remote decoder with its manager.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340160\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340562\n", "files": ["dom/media/ipc/MFMediaEngineParent.cpp", "dom/media/ipc/MFMediaEngineParent.h", "dom/media/ipc/RemoteAudioDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/ipc/RemoteDecoderParent.cpp", "dom/media/ipc/RemoteDecoderParent.h", "dom/media/ipc/RemoteVideoDecoder.cpp"], "git_node": "1c2845019dea6425f3a9deb716ab64e61d9ca748", "git_parents": ["f2d24e7af25e4de53f0730a7df43207f51200c9f"], "node": "98c2d93045486eee88cf7ac