ranch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump\n\nach -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\naf -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nan -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nar -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nast -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\naz -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nbe -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nbg -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nbn -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nbr -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nbs -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nca -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nca-valencia -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\ncak -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\ncs -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\ncy -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nda -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nde -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\ndsb -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nel -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nen-CA -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nen-GB -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\neo -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nes-AR -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nes-CL -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nes-ES -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nes-MX -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\net -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\neu -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nfa -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nff -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nfi -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nfr -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nfur -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nfy-NL -\u003e c537a8ee146196a264e7b2664d0666e6d2bcab68\nga-IE -\u003e c5