om/D341350\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsINode.cpp", "dom/base/nsINode.h"], "git_node": "91461bf2f04ab9198e2d6341567503c43ebfa199", "git_parents": ["f9258650984d5b623859c61d38201d65a3e95826"], "node": "c11da8d54f09e17a90e099d3e240c052fcdeb1a8", "parents": ["d77ce8d3bc11f9fad73fa9d21b73377a8c43b026"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794367475, "git_changesets": ["91461bf2f04ab9198e2d6341567503c43ebfa199"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "29363": {"changesets": [{"author": "Simon Farre \u003csfarre@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2090118 - Add script runner for ExternalResourceMap::PendingLoad::StartLoad  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340912\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341308\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp"], "git_node": "c033507a3ddb385d04925924ba470987386bc0eb", "git_parents": ["91461bf2f04ab9198e2d6341567503c43ebfa199"], "node": "c9731253c0b0e36a63dce17edfd4b900d3746d70", "parents": ["c11da8d54f09e17a90e099d3e240c052fcdeb1a8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794367546, "git_changesets": ["c033507a3ddb385d04925924ba470987386bc0eb"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "29364": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2085481 - Serialize the cache-entry check with cancel  a=diannaS\n\nOnCacheEntryCheck can run on the cache I/O thread and write the cached state\n(alt-data type, cached response head, cache input stream) while a cancel's\nAsyncAbort reads it on the main thread.  Set mCanceled under mCacheWaitLock so\nan in-flight check finishes first, and decline any later check.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340727\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340931\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannel.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannel.h"], "git_node": "782ff307c1a942e5c280839e9c221d222cea19d0", "git_parents": ["c033507a3ddb385d04925924ba470987386bc0eb"], "node": "44c96564f98d01b95cd15016a955d2209b65aa67", "parents": ["c9731253c0b0e36a63dce17edfd4b900d3746d70"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794367569, "git_changesets": ["782ff307c1a942e5c280839e9c221d222cea19d0"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "29365": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079465 - Keep an invalid trailer at the end of cache entry files while their data is being written.  a=diannaS\n\nData writes and truncations put an 8-byte trailer, whose offset word is past\nthe end of any file, after the end of the file; the metadata write truncates it\naway.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340568\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340936\n", "files": ["netwerk/cache2/CacheFileIOManager.cpp", "netwerk/cache2/CacheFileIOManager.h"], "git_node": "72420a13d85414131ea890581d7d34eb5e10fb6b", "git_parents": ["782ff307c1a942e5c280839e9c221d222cea19d0"], "node": "d37669383cead426f8abd1aa092629bd3227d181", "parents": ["44c96564f98d01b95cd15016a955d2209b65aa67"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794367593, "git_changesets": ["72420a13d85414131ea890581d7d34eb5e10fb6b"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "29366": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088537 - Bind child-written alt-data to the writer's remote type and require a fully loaded origin.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340412\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340928\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpChannelParent.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpChannelParent.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannel.cpp"], "git_node": "3411e1e7b85f6020e2c67de927e3ba79b2961a24", "git_parents": ["72420a13d85414131ea890581d7d34eb5e10fb6b"], "node": "73c7ea665c33b60468f87a48a197ac632ab611b6", "parents": [