Keeler \u003cdkeeler@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086816 - enforce some ETSI cryptography minimums for QWACs a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341628\n", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/QWACTrustDomain.cpp", "security/manager/ssl/qwac_trust_anchors/test_trust_anchors/test-ca-small-rsa.pem", "security/manager/ssl/qwac_trust_anchors/test_trust_anchors/test-ca-small-rsa.pem.certspec", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs.js", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-sha1.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-sha1.pem.certspec", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-small-rsa-key.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-small-rsa-key.pem.certspec", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-small-rsa-signature.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-small-rsa-signature.pem.certspec", "security/manager/ssl/trust-anchor-build-util/src/lib.rs"], "git_node": "e50931e9df10695029f555499127cce2d58607b2", "git_parents": ["a7696a65638a76338cca41406f0778488a3ff465"], "node": "db88cd44d309ad8bc96b6d530f51267ceaedf609", "parents": ["59a459c11ced5e32d33185ddec262e4a93066353"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2090126 - Notify when updating the image document's alt text. a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340868\n", "files": ["dom/html/ImageDocument.cpp"], "git_node": "4dacc3239f8e822f95fbd3bcea481f3f5c2f98b2", "git_parents": ["e50931e9df10695029f555499127cce2d58607b2"], "node": "3cf0e2cadca90b419c6e1a26d4c13751ce9022c4", "parents": ["db88cd44d309ad8bc96b6d530f51267ceaedf609"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794904439, "git_changesets": ["f1bcb2f9f0cf4a23352d890c8e831d79ba59c771", "a7696a65638a76338cca41406f0778488a3ff465", "e50931e9df10695029f555499127cce2d58607b2", "4dacc3239f8e822f95fbd3bcea481f3f5c2f98b2"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "29464": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2092666 - Make the NTLM test servers echo the signing flags in their type 2 challenge.  a=pascalc\n\nSince KB5135557 SSPI offers NTLMSSP_NEGOTIATE_SIGN and fails the type 2\nwith SEC_E_UNSUPPORTED_FUNCTION when the server's challenge doesn't\naccept it, so test_ntlm_web_auth.js and\ntest_ntlm_native_server_validation.js never sent a type 3 on Windows.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343094\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343440\n", "files": ["netwerk/test/unit/test_ntlm_native_server_validation.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_ntlm_web_auth.js", "netwerk/test/unit/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "2aee52a4b719ce4c25248b44db6387c6c02f2de3", "git_parents": ["4dacc3239f8e822f95fbd3bcea481f3f5c2f98b2"], "node": "41414641ec02ca0618b75c92f0bfaa5d23525ca3", "parents": ["3cf0e2cadca90b419c6e1a26d4c13751ce9022c4"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794905252, "git_changesets": ["2aee52a4b719ce4c25248b44db6387c6c02f2de3"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "29465": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ed Lee \u003cedilee@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068201 - send smart cursor text to chatbot with annotations  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342780\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343407\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-window/ai-window.mjs", "browser/components/genai/GenAI.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "3588b2472e6d950609bb0130d0c76fae6b2b62d6", "git_parents": ["2aee52a4b719ce4c25248b44db6387c6c02f2de3"], "node": "cdece59687ae31ed62aea1fd26c89dcb5d7dcecd", "parents": ["41414641ec02ca0618b75c92f0bfaa5d23525ca3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794905274, "git_changesets": ["3588b2472e6d950609bb0130d0c76fae6b2b62d6"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "29466": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091345 - Don't cache initial shapes that can be replaced by SharedShape::insertInitialShape.  a=pascalc\n\nFor some classes we replace the initial empty-shape entry in the table with the\nshape that has builtin properties added to it. Future lookups then get the final\nshape instead of the empty shape.\n\nThis complicates the `ShapeCachePtr` `ShapeWithProto` optimization because it's\nbased on matching the shape in the table. The easiest fix is to not use that\noptimization for those replaceable empty shapes. This patch adds a shape flag\nto make that cheap.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342641\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343398\n", "files": ["js/src/vm/Shape.cpp", "js/src/vm/Shape.h"], "git_node": "3aefc192937e20583971e7e846bca8ab1601699a", "git_parents": ["3588b2472e6d950609bb0130d0c76fae6b2b62d6"], "node": "bc9f3b2a256bebbc04e9162a7ea92cfaf36c9d04", "parents": ["cdece59687ae31ed62aea1fd26c89dcb5d7dcecd"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794905334, "git_changesets": ["3aefc192937e20583971e7e846bca8ab1601699a"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "29467": {"changesets": [{"author": "Rebecca King \u003crking@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088115 - Remove VPN from toolbar does not work on a second discovery callout if used before -  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342734\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343324\n", "files": ["browser/components/ipprotection/IPPOptOutHelper.sys.mjs", "browser/components/ipprotection/tests/browser/browser_ipprotection_optout.js"], "git_node": "b6ca7de03e7a044d1e2fded5291c269028493bf5", "git_parents": ["3aefc192937e20583971e7e846bca8ab1601699a"], "node": "f45af1d5e72aca4beefc090b6d3ab205b0e273a0", "parents": ["bc9f3b2a256bebbc04e9162a7ea92cfaf36c9d04"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794905358, "git_changesets": ["b6ca7de03e7a044d1e2fded5291c269028493bf5"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "29468": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2090776 - Only use compression dictionaries for readable responses.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342513\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343264\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannel.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannel.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpHandler.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpHandler.h"], "git_node": "db95a09759eb19467462b675c4b892c2f50fc856", "git_parents": ["b6ca7de03e7a044d1e2fded5291c269028493bf5"], "node": "93b14654756460974961cfd205fefab447f6aa58", "parents": ["f45af1d5e72aca4beefc090b6d3ab205b0e273a0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794905503, "git_changesets": ["db95a09759eb19467462b675c4b892c2f50fc856"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "29469": {"changesets": [{"author": "Harveer Singh \u003chsingh@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077077 - Dispatch the worker memory reporter's runnable through the worker's control event target.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338019\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343229\n", "files": ["dom/workers/WorkerPrivate.cpp"], "git_node": "1bf1e5f922c5c33f884023286d2122fc268c6d8e", "git_parents": ["db95a09759eb19467462b675c4b892c2f50fc856"], "node": "67b2bd7f10f38162783ac087fa1f65bbcc8e7cd1", "parents": ["93b14654756460974961cfd205fefab447f6aa58"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794905545, "git_changesets": ["1bf1e5f922c5c33f884023286d2122fc268c6d8e"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "29470": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2090900 - Stop setting up a document viewer once another one has replaced the old one.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342108\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343199\n", "files": ["docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp"], "git_node": "1afea4164cd68405667ccf9c95203290f96b17eb", "git_parents": ["1bf1e5f922c5c33f884023286d2122fc268c6d8e"], "node": "3fb6b91c2b133e9514d042a1a87f2dcc0c06fb09", "parents": ["67b2bd7f10f38162783ac087fa1f65bbcc8e7cd1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794905578, "git_changesets": ["1afea4164cd68405667ccf9c95203290f96b17eb"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "29471": {"changesets": [{"author": "Arne Fucks \u003cafucks@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084710 - Handle parsed /etc/hosts entries on main thread.  a=pascalc\n\nAdditionally unset sTRRServicePtr when destroying TRRService.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342654\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343145\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/TRRService.cpp"], "git_node": "89d93203c979897b1039c3ff3f6ba825bebb3513", "git_parents": ["1afea4164cd68405667ccf9c95203290f96b17eb"], "node": "dcfa78a5825290a877dc217185a3efdabee6d1e5", "parents": ["3fb6b91c2b133e9514d042a1a87f2dcc0c06fb09"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794905764, "git_changesets": ["89d93203c979897b1039c3ff3f6ba825bebb3513"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "29472": {"changesets": [{"author": "Celeste \"Coelacanthus\" Liu \u003cuwu@coelacanthus.name\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2093248 - should pass length w/o NUL into AddNativeFontHandle().  a=pascalc\n\nAddNativeFontHandle() forwards the filename length to a length-based\nstd::string constructor which expect without NUL. Including NUL makes\nit has an extra NUL in content, then the stored path compare unequal\nto Fontconfig's identical filename, triggering fallback that clears\nthe named-instance bits so it use wrongly default one.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343047\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343110\n", "files": ["gfx/webrender_bindings/src/moz2d_renderer.rs"], "git_node": "1264e29026f12583bce6ff5c1afe71e83a3aba25", "git_parents": ["89d93203c979897b1039c3ff3f6ba825bebb3513"], "node": "936506c4edc6bb741497c7b3c8d56dea7f947aab", "parents": ["dcfa78a5825290a877dc217185a3efdabee6d1e5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794906116, "git_changesets": ["1264e29026f12583bce6ff5c1afe71e83a3aba25"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "29473": {"changesets": [{"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump\n\nach -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\naf -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nan -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nar -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nast -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\naz -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nbe -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nbg -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nbn -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nbr -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nbs -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nca -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nca-valencia -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\ncak -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\ncs -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\ncy -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nda -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nde -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\ndsb -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nel -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nen-CA -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nen-GB -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\neo -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nes-AR -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f9d398c99dfd1eb82c\nes-CL -\u003e 6cc0f63e0eaee91d31f8d9f